# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What does not belong in the repository
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------

# OpenSCAD and PrusaSlicer, which the app carries in assets/bin.
# 242 MB of somebody else's compiled programs. They are not ours to keep in
# our history, every clone would have to download them, and PrusaSlicer.dll
# alone is 66 MB, which GitHub complains about. See the README for where to
# get them. Everything else under assets IS ours and is committed.
assets/bin/

# PyInstaller's own output.
build/
dist/
*.manifest

# Your language, printer model, IP address and port. Personal to whoever
# ran the app, and an IP address on a school network is nobody's business
# but the school's.
config.json

# Made while the app runs.
work/
projects/
selftest-output/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Editors and operating systems
.vscode/*
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Things the app makes and leaves in Downloads, in case anyone works there
bgeraprint_model.*
*.gcode
